  "story": {
    "title": "Our Story",
    "text1": "Orang Sweet Plazza was born from a simple belief — that the finest sweets should be within reach of every family. Nestled in the heart of Ambernath, we have been crafting traditional mithai, namkeen and festive hampers with the same love and care that has been passed down through generations. Every piece of Kaju Katli, every laddoo, every dry-fruit barfi that leaves our kitchen carries the warmth of a home-made recipe and the precision of a master craftsman. We source only the purest ingredients — real ghee, fresh mawa, premium dry fruits — because we believe your family deserves nothing less.",
    "text2": "Over the years, Orang Sweet Plazza has grown from a neighbourhood favourite into the go-to destination for corporate gifting, wedding hampers and Diwali celebrations across Thane and beyond. Yet our promise remains unchanged: every sweet we make is free from preservatives, crafted fresh daily, and packed with the kind of flavour that turns an ordinary moment into a cherished memory. Whether you are picking up a box for a festival, sending a hamper to a client, or simply treating yourself after a long day — we are here to make it sweeter.",
    "image": ""
  },
